window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-020.json",{"day":20,"title":"The Shelter Beyond the Racecourse","targetWords":[{"word":"jockey","gloss":"赛马的骑师","context":"A tornado warning reached the racecourse just as a jockey was preparing for the afternoon's final event.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"judiciary","gloss":"司法系统","context":"A secular charity proposed multilateral cooperation with neighboring towns, while a local lawyer urged the judiciary to investigate fraud after the emergency.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"lavish","gloss":"奢华的","context":"They could not offer lavish comfort, but they could offer warmth.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"malice","gloss":"恶意","context":"The difficult task was now to prevent relief from becoming a competition in moral superiority or a disguise for malice.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"marsh","gloss":"沼泽","context":"Beyond the track lay a marsh, an abandoned observatory, and a neighborhood that had received little attention since the baby boom.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"martyr","gloss":"殉难者","context":"A retired soldier warned against turning every responder into a martyr: praise should never conceal negligent planning or an oversight that forces ordinary workers to accept needless danger.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"mow","gloss":"修剪草地","context":"They refused to mow wet ground simply to improve the view for journalists.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"multilateral","gloss":"多边的","context":"A secular charity proposed multilateral cooperation with neighboring towns, while a local lawyer urged the judiciary to investigate fraud after the emergency.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"negligent","gloss":"疏忽的","context":"A retired soldier warned against turning every responder into a martyr: praise should never conceal negligent planning or an oversight that forces ordinary workers to accept needless danger.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"observatory","gloss":"天文台","context":"Beyond the track lay a marsh, an abandoned observatory, and a neighborhood that had received little attention since the baby boom.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"onward","gloss":"向前的","context":"The mayor's aide directed everyone onward to a school shelter, but official instructions used an abbreviation that few visitors understood.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"outgoing","gloss":"即将卸任的","context":"The outgoing mayor wanted reassurance on camera; the volunteers wanted reliable information about the roof, the roads, and the people still outside.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"oversight","gloss":"疏漏","context":"A retired soldier warned against turning every responder into a martyr: praise should never conceal negligent planning or an oversight that forces ordinary workers to accept needless danger.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"parrot","gloss":"鹦鹉","context":"Inside, a stout cook wearing an apron stirred porridge while children watched a parrot sway on its temporary prop.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"peddle","gloss":"兜售","context":"As rumors spread, an opportunist tried to peddle expensive emergency aids at the gate.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"porridge","gloss":"粥","context":"Inside, a stout cook wearing an apron stirred porridge while children watched a parrot sway on its temporary prop.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"prop","gloss":"支架","context":"Inside, a stout cook wearing an apron stirred porridge while children watched a parrot sway on its temporary prop.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"reminiscent","gloss":"使人想起的","context":"The scene was reminiscent of an old war photograph, but armor and artillery would have been useless here.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"salon","gloss":"会客厅","context":"An assorted collection of donated chairs filled the former salon used for community meetings.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"sarcasm","gloss":"讽刺","context":"A joke intended to tickle the children worked better than the sarcasm of a visitor who treated every imperfect arrangement as evidence of incompetence.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"scrub","gloss":"擦洗","context":"Volunteers had to scrub the floor, check the sodium content of meals, and prevent air-conditioning equipment from leaking onto blankets.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"secular","gloss":"非宗教的","context":"A secular charity proposed multilateral cooperation with neighboring towns, while a local lawyer urged the judiciary to investigate fraud after the emergency.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"shred","gloss":"一点","context":"By dawn, the storm had passed, leaving one shred of good news: every missing resident had been located.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"snob","gloss":"势利小人","context":"A self-described expert behaved like a snob toward volunteers without qualifications, until the cook asked him to wash bowls.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"sodium","gloss":"钠","context":"Volunteers had to scrub the floor, check the sodium content of meals, and prevent air-conditioning equipment from leaking onto blankets.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"squad","gloss":"小队","context":"Outside, a rescue squad worked beside the railway.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"stout","gloss":"（身体）结实的","context":"Inside, a stout cook wearing an apron stirred porridge while children watched a parrot sway on its temporary prop.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"streak","gloss":"一道光","context":"A streak of lightning illuminated a horse lifted aloft by rescue straps, while another team moved a frightened ass from a flooded shed.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"stump","gloss":"树桩","context":"One chair needed a tack; another had only a tree stump for support.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"tack","gloss":"小钉子","context":"One chair needed a tack; another had only a tree stump for support.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"tickle","gloss":"逗乐","context":"A joke intended to tickle the children worked better than the sarcasm of a visitor who treated every imperfect arrangement as evidence of incompetence.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"tornado","gloss":"龙卷风","context":"A tornado warning reached the racecourse just as a jockey was preparing for the afternoon's final event.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"abbreviation","gloss":"缩写","context":"The mayor's aide directed everyone onward to a school shelter, but official instructions used an abbreviation that few visitors understood.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"aide","gloss":"助手","context":"The mayor's aide directed everyone onward to a school shelter, but official instructions used an abbreviation that few visitors understood.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"aids","gloss":"辅助用品","context":"As rumors spread, an opportunist tried to peddle expensive emergency aids at the gate.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"air-conditioning","gloss":"空调","context":"Volunteers had to scrub the floor, check the sodium content of meals, and prevent air-conditioning equipment from leaking onto blankets.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"almighty","gloss":"全能的","context":"No almighty authority could instantly solve every shortage.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"aloft","gloss":"在空中","context":"A streak of lightning illuminated a horse lifted aloft by rescue straps, while another team moved a frightened ass from a flooded shed.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"am","gloss":"是","context":"One anxious resident asked whether 'Am I safe here?' was a question anyone could answer honestly.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"antagonism","gloss":"敌意","context":"Officials needed to arbitrate a dispute over supplies without inflaming antagonism between residents and newcomers.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"apron","gloss":"围裙","context":"Inside, a stout cook wearing an apron stirred porridge while children watched a parrot sway on its temporary prop.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"arbitrate","gloss":"仲裁","context":"Officials needed to arbitrate a dispute over supplies without inflaming antagonism between residents and newcomers.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"armor","gloss":"装甲","context":"The scene was reminiscent of an old war photograph, but armor and artillery would have been useless here.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"artillery","gloss":"火炮","context":"The scene was reminiscent of an old war photograph, but armor and artillery would have been useless here.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"ass","gloss":"驴","context":"A streak of lightning illuminated a horse lifted aloft by rescue straps, while another team moved a frightened ass from a flooded shed.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"assorted","gloss":"各种各样的","context":"An assorted collection of donated chairs filled the former salon used for community meetings.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"atrocity","gloss":"暴行","context":"Stories of atrocity from distant disasters showed how quickly fear could destroy trust when communities stopped checking claims and began treating unfamiliar people as enemies.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"avenge","gloss":"报复","context":"Nor should anger become a license to avenge an insult.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"baby boom","gloss":"婴儿潮","context":"Beyond the track lay a marsh, an abandoned observatory, and a neighborhood that had received little attention since the baby boom.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"baffle","gloss":"使困惑","context":"That simple request seemed to baffle him more than any technical problem.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"A tornado warning reached the racecourse just as a jockey was preparing for the afternoon's final event. Beyond the track lay a marsh, an abandoned observatory, and a neighborhood that had received little attention since the baby boom. The mayor's aide directed everyone onward to a school shelter, but official instructions used an abbreviation that few visitors understood. One anxious resident asked whether 'Am I safe here?' was a question anyone could answer honestly. The outgoing mayor wanted reassurance on camera; the volunteers wanted reliable information about the roof, the roads, and the people still outside.","zh":"龙卷风警报传到赛马场时，一名骑师正准备参加下午最后一场比赛。跑道外是沼泽、废弃天文台，以及一个自婴儿潮以来便很少得到关注的社区。市长助手让大家继续前往学校避难所，但通知中的缩写让许多游客不明所以。一位焦虑的居民问，是否有人能诚实回答‘我在这里安全吗’。即将卸任的市长想在镜头前安抚公众，志愿者则想获得屋顶、道路和仍在户外的人们的可靠信息。"},{"en":"Inside, a stout cook wearing an apron stirred porridge while children watched a parrot sway on its temporary prop. An assorted collection of donated chairs filled the former salon used for community meetings. One chair needed a tack; another had only a tree stump for support. Volunteers had to scrub the floor, check the sodium content of meals, and prevent air-conditioning equipment from leaking onto blankets. They could not offer lavish comfort, but they could offer warmth. A joke intended to tickle the children worked better than the sarcasm of a visitor who treated every imperfect arrangement as evidence of incompetence.","zh":"避难所里，一位系围裙的壮实厨师搅着粥，孩子们看着鹦鹉在临时支架上晃动。原先用于社区会议的会客厅摆满了各式捐赠椅子，有的需要钉子固定，有的只靠树桩支撑。志愿者擦洗地板、检查饭菜含钠量，还得防止空调漏水打湿毯子。这里没有奢华的舒适，但有温暖。逗孩子开心的笑话，比一名访客把所有不完美都讥讽为无能的做法更有效。"},{"en":"Outside, a rescue squad worked beside the railway. They refused to mow wet ground simply to improve the view for journalists. A streak of lightning illuminated a horse lifted aloft by rescue straps, while another team moved a frightened ass from a flooded shed. The scene was reminiscent of an old war photograph, but armor and artillery would have been useless here. What mattered was patient coordination. A retired soldier warned against turning every responder into a martyr: praise should never conceal negligent planning or an oversight that forces ordinary workers to accept needless danger.","zh":"外面的救援小队在铁路旁作业。他们不肯仅为改善记者拍摄画面而修剪湿地植被。一道闪电照亮了用吊带升起的马，另一队则把受惊的驴从被淹的棚屋中转移出来。场景令人想起战争旧照片，但装甲和火炮在这里毫无用处，重要的是耐心协调。一位退役军人警告，不要把每个救援人员塑造成殉难者：赞美不能掩盖疏忽的规划，或迫使普通劳动者承担无谓危险的遗漏。"},{"en":"As rumors spread, an opportunist tried to peddle expensive emergency aids at the gate. Officials needed to arbitrate a dispute over supplies without inflaming antagonism between residents and newcomers. A secular charity proposed multilateral cooperation with neighboring towns, while a local lawyer urged the judiciary to investigate fraud after the emergency. No almighty authority could instantly solve every shortage. Nor should anger become a license to avenge an insult. Stories of atrocity from distant disasters showed how quickly fear could destroy trust when communities stopped checking claims and began treating unfamiliar people as enemies.","zh":"谣言蔓延时，一个投机者在门口兜售昂贵的应急用品。官员需要仲裁物资争议，却不能激化居民与外来者的敌意。一家非宗教慈善机构提议与周边城镇开展多边合作，律师则建议灾后由司法部门调查欺诈。没有全能的权威可以瞬间解决所有短缺，愤怒也不应成为报复侮辱的许可。远方灾难中暴行的故事显示：一旦人们不再核实说法，而把陌生人当作敌人，恐惧便会迅速摧毁信任。"},{"en":"By dawn, the storm had passed, leaving one shred of good news: every missing resident had been located. The difficult task was now to prevent relief from becoming a competition in moral superiority or a disguise for malice. A self-described expert behaved like a snob toward volunteers without qualifications, until the cook asked him to wash bowls. That simple request seemed to baffle him more than any technical problem. The shelter had demonstrated that practical kindness depends on small, accountable acts. It also showed why a community should remember the people who keep it functioning when dramatic speeches and television crews have moved elsewhere.","zh":"黎明时风暴已过，传来一点好消息：所有失联居民都找到了。接下来的难题，是防止救助变成比拼道德优越感的竞赛，或成为恶意的伪装。一位自称专家的人势利地轻视没有资格证的志愿者，直到厨师请他洗碗。这个简单请求似乎比任何技术问题都更令他困惑。避难所证明，实际的善意依赖一个个负责的小行动，也说明了社区为何应记住那些在激昂演说和电视摄制组离开后，仍维持生活运转的人。"}],"previous":19,"next":21});
